        <activityName xml:lang="en">Coffee ground pellets, burned in wood furnace 25kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Coffee ground pellets, burned in wood furnace 25kW
Air emission coffee ground data completed with ecoinvent inventory of "pellets, mixed, burned in furnace 15kW";
UUID: 7b6701eb-ff77-342f-bd52-055ada76b1a4
This data set describes the emission into air caused by the combustion, infrastructure, fuel input and transport are included
Location: The inventory is modelled for a pilot plant in Switzerland
Technology: Furnace 25kW
Time period: Collection of data and publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: Several air emissions estimated with data for wood combustion.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7b6701eb-ff77-342f-bd52-055ada76b1a4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
